build_*.py
# ...but NOT the documentation manual's build script, which is a deliverable rather than a scratch
# file. `build_*.py` here targets throwaway build helpers dropped at the repo root; it also matched
# `docs/build_html.py`, so the commit that claimed to add that script committed only .gitignore and
# a README telling the reader to run it. Nobody cloning this repo had the script. Found 2026-08-27.
!docs/build_html.py
fix*.py
fix2*.py
